**Purpose:** from order to verified result.

**Functions**
- Test catalogue with price, sample type, unit, reference ranges (by age and sex), turnaround time. [V1 basic]
- Lab worklist: ordered, paid, collected, in progress, resulted, verified. [V1+]
- Sample collection with barcode or sample ID label. [NEW]
- Result entry per test, panel templates (CBC, urinalysis, LFT, RFT), automatic abnormal flags. [V1 single result]
- Two-step: entered by technician, verified by senior technician before release. [NEW]
- Rejection of poor samples with reason and recollect request. [NEW]
- Critical value alert to doctor. [NEW]
- Result print and result history trend per patient. [NEW]
- Reagent and consumable use per test, linked to lab sub-store. [NEW]
- Referral to outside lab with tracking. [NEW]
- Instrument interface (HL7 or CSV import), optional. [NEW]
- Internal quality control log. [NEW]

**Access**

| Role | Access |
|---|---|
| LAB | Process orders, enter results, manage test catalogue (catalogue changes limited to a lead technician) |
| DOC | Order tests, read results of own patients |
| NUR | Read results; collect samples if permitted |
| MGR, AUD | Read |
