- Daily dispensing and consumption report. [NEW]

**Access**

| Role | Access |
|---|---|
| PHA | Dispense, adjust dispensary stock with reason, manage formulary prices (price changes approved by finance) |
| DOC | Prescribe; see stock availability |
| WRD | Request drugs for ward stock, record medication administration |
| STO | Issue stock to dispensary |
| MGR, AUD | Read |

**Permissions:** `pharmacy.prescription.read`, `pharmacy.dispense`, `pharmacy.otc.sell`, `pharmacy.return.create`, `pharmacy.stock.adjust`, `pharmacy.formulary.manage`, `pharmacy.controlled.dispense`.

**Rules:** stock never goes below zero; dispensing is one database transaction (all items or none); every adjustment needs a reason.

