- Clinic profile: name, logo, address, letterhead for print, currency, time zone, number formats (MRN, invoice, receipt).
- Master data: departments, wards and beds, price lists, service catalogue, insurers and payers, ICD-10 list, units, payment methods, document templates.
- Branch / facility setup if the clinic has more than one site.
- Notification settings (SMS and email gateways, templates).
- Approval workflow settings: limits and approvers for discounts, refunds, write-offs, purchase orders.
- Data tools: backup and restore, data import (patients, items, prices), data export.
- System health: version, database status, scheduled jobs, error log.

**Access**

| Role | Access |
|---|---|
| ADM | Full on this module; no read of clinical notes or salaries |
| MGR | Read; approve changes to price list and approval limits |
| Others | Own profile and own password only |

**Permissions:** `admin.user.create`, `admin.user.update`, `admin.user.deactivate`, `admin.user.reset`, `admin.role.manage`, `admin.settings.manage`, `admin.masterdata.manage`, `admin.backup.run`, `admin.import.run`.

